'''Shiraht''' was one of the [[Eska]] {{dis|hunter|occupation}}s encountered in [[2151]] by {{EnterpriseNX}} while [[stalking]] the [[indigenous]] [[wraith]]s on [[Dakala]]. Shiraht was surprised by one of these beings after [[Captain]] [[Jonathan Archer]] provided the wraiths with a [[chemical masking agent]]. ({{ENT|Rogue Planet}})

{{bginfo|Shiraht was played by [[Eric Pierpoint]].|His name comes from the [[script]]. He was originally to have been called "Alien Hunter #2" but was given the name "Shiraht" instead on {{d|13|December|2001}}.}}

